```{r setup, include=FALSE}
knitr::opts_chunk$set(echo = TRUE, message = FALSE, warning = FALSE)
options(width = 120)
input_path <- knitr::current_input(dir = TRUE)
project_root <- if (nzchar(input_path)) dirname(normalizePath(input_path, winslash = "/")) else normalizePath(getwd(), winslash = "/")
knitr::opts_knit$set(root.dir = project_root)
p <- function(...) file.path(project_root, ...)
read_lines <- function(path) if (file.exists(path)) readLines(path, warn = FALSE) else character()
read_tsv <- function(path, n = -1) {
  if (!file.exists(path)) return(data.frame(message = paste("Missing:", path)))
  utils::read.delim(path, sep = "\t", quote = "", check.names = FALSE, nrows = n)
}
file_table <- function(paths) {
  full <- p(paths)
  data.frame(file = paths, exists = file.exists(full), size_bytes = ifelse(file.exists(full), file.info(full)$size, NA), row.names = NULL)
}
```

# 这个 Rmd 的目的

本文档说明 __PAPER_IDENTITY__ Fig. __FIGURE_PANEL__ 的完整后端交付：科学输入、作者代码映射、用户参数、绘图接口、当前输出、运行环境和验证证据。内容必须按当前案例适配，删除模板提示语和不适用段落。

<div class="hero-note">推荐阅读顺序：先核对任务与输入，再查看参数和后端接口，最后比较生成图、参考图和验证结果。</div>

